# R2 triggerdotdev/trigger.dev apps/webapp, commit b21b2ec2f6928b2257676c5d4955723075bf380e
# Hand-derived from the files under app/routes/** with the Remix v2 default flat routes (vite.config.ts remix({ ignoredRouteFiles: ["**/.*"] }); no custom routes()).
# Rule: a file directly under routes/ is a route, a folder is a route only through its route.{tsx,ts,jsx,js} (id = folder name; sibling files in folders are not routes);
# '.' separates segments; a leading '_' segment is pathless (_app); _index is the index route; $param -> :param; $ -> * ([_].$ would be '/_/*', it has no default export);
# a trailing '_' on a segment only breaks nesting ($organizationSlug_ -> :organizationSlug); [x] escapes a literal segment.
# Only modules with a default export are screens; the 389 route modules without one (resources.*, api.*, admin.api.*, loader-only redirects) are excluded.
# /orgs/:organizationSlug and /orgs/:organizationSlug/projects/:projectParam are not URLs — their _index children are loader-only redirects with computed targets, so the layout never renders at that URL; /storybook/layout is (storybook.layout/route.tsx has a default export); /auth/github and /auth/google are included as redirect sources (unconditional loader redirect('/login')).
